        {
          "text": ". Every other window in this chapter gains five dots and leaves one string untouched. Checked against all five, this is the only one where nothing is left alone — the layer fills in the whole hand at once rather than five-sixths of it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Three of those new dots are "
        },
        {
          "text": "b6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": "s — "
        },
        {
          "text": "5·8",
